\code{\link[=getMetadata]{getMetadata()}}, \code{\link[=HVGs]{HVGs()}}, \code{\link[=DimReduction]{DimReduction()}} and \code{\link[=DEGs]{DEGs()}}. The example
dataset is \link{Snail1KO}. See \code{vignette("Snail1_Vignette", package = "RGenEDA")} for a full walk-through.
